I have had trouble trying to install Latex3e using PCTeX on DOS
because the files I ftp'd have LF's instead of CRLF's.  However,
I found an Awk program I wrote a long time ago that fixes this.

Save this as unix2dos.awk:

-------------------------

# BEGIN { RS = "\12" }   # set line separator to LF

{ print $0 }             # print every line

------------------------------

Public domain Awks are available on DOS archives.  This one
works with GAWK and is so simple it ought to work with any AWK.

